<title>USA: CCC seeks up to 10,000 T US soybeans for Ukraine.</title>
<headline>CCC seeks up to 10,000 T US soybeans for Ukraine.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp of the U.S. Department of Agriculture said it was tendering on April 30 for up to 10,000 tonnes of U.S. yellow soybeans for export to Ukraine, May 10-June 5 shipment.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408 8720))</p>
